Visa Information System-Ordinance (VISO)
SR 142.512 — Ordinance of 18 December 2013 on the Central Visa Information System and the National Visa System (Visa Information System-Ordinance, VISO).
|

:NOTE [links:https://fedlex.data.admin.ch/eli/cc/2014/2]
English is not an official language of the Swiss Confederation. This translation is provided for information purposes only and has no legal force.
This English text is the consolidation of 1 January 2025. The binding German, French and Italian texts have since been consolidated to 12 June 2026, so this translation is behind current law.

:INFO
Preamble
The Swiss Federal Council,
on the basis of Article 109e of the Foreign Nationals and Integration Act of 16 December 2005 (FNIA),
ordains:
